flowchart TD
    A[Register source version] --> B{Schema valid?}
    B -- No --> C[Reject and report validation errors]
    B -- Yes --> D[Extract candidate rules]
    D --> E{Explicit and deterministic?}
    E -- Yes --> F[System 1: run deterministic checks]
    E -- No --> G[System 2: flag ambiguity and evidence]
    F --> H[Reviewer inspects candidate and provenance]
    G --> H
    H --> I{Accepted?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Record accepted rule and review event]
    I -- No --> K[Record rejection or request clarification]
    J --> L[Publish versioned traceable output]
    K --> M[Preserve decision and rationale]
